:[{"c":"HCC 2018 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the fourth quarter was 93% of the Platts premium low vol FOB Australian Index price, reflecting a rising price environment during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2018 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"However, as we have previously disclosed, this should even out through the cycle and over the long term, our price realization should be nearly 100% on the average index price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2018 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Lucas Pipes","x":"Obviously you're tendering for the $150 million on the debt side is that the right size to think about?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2019-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the first quarter was 98% of the Platts premium low vol FOB Australian index price and was comparable to the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2019-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"There was no special discounting on our sales due to solid demand and price fundamentals resulting in our high gross price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2019-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the second quarter was 97% of the Platts premium low-vol FOB Australian index price, and was down slightly from the prior-year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2019-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale Boyles","x":"Demurrage and other charges reduced our gross price realization to an average net selling price of $173 per short ton in the second quarter of 2019 compared to $167 in the same period last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2019-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"As a result of the company's performance in the first half of the year and expected market conditions for the remainder of 2019, we're raising our full-year guidance for sales and production volumes, which we will discuss later.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2019-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David Gagliano","x":"You obviously raised the guidance for the year on the sales volumes and what you just addressed, I think, a bit in your prepared remarks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the third quarter was 102% of the Platts Premium Low Vol FOB Australian Index price and was higher than the prior-year period of 97%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale Boyles","x":"Our gross price realization was 102% in the third quarter of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dale Boyles","x":"We are reaffirming our guidance for the full year 2019 as previously issued during our second-quarter call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"However, after considering the expected market conditions for the remainder of the year, along with our strong performance year to date, we are reaffirming our 2019 guidance targets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dale Boyles","x":"Price and volatility accelerated in the second half of 2019 as the trade and tariff war with China continued, and China began to impose increasingly tighter port restrictions on coal imports during the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"We recognize that certain macroeconomic factors, such as a potential slowdown in regional GDP growth rates and the trade and tariff war with China, the coronavirus outbreak, as well as the reduction in steel demand Europe, have the potential to create a soft pricing environment for hard coking coal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walt Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the fourth quarter was 97% of the Platts Premium Low Vol FOB Australian Index price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale Boyles","x":"Our gross price realization was 97% in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2019 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2020-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Lucas Pipes","x":"Good afternoon, everybody, and I want to echo some of the earlier congratulations on truly outstanding operational performance since you've emerged from new restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/19/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2020 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale Boyles","x":"Demurrage and other charges reduced our gross price realization to an average net selling price of $122 per short ton in the first quarter of 2020 compared to $176 per short ton in the same period last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2020 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David Gagliano","x":"Walt Scheller Well, in terms of the market in Q2, David, frankly, that's one of the reasons we withdrew guidance, just things are changing on a daily basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2020 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Lucas Pipes","x":"Walt Scheller Again, we withdrew guidance because so much of that is in flux right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"HCC 2020 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the fourth quarter of 2020 was 102% of the Platts Premium Low Vol FOB Australian index price and was higher than the 97% achieved in the prior year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2020 Q4","e":"hcc","d":"2021-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"Our better gross price realization was primarily due to a higher percentage of our sales being exposed to spot sales with lower relativities due to a fundamental oversupply in the marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2021 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization for the first quarter of 2021 was 95% of the Platts premium lowball fob Australian index price and was higher than the 89% achieved in the prior year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2021 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"Or better gross price realization was primarily due to a higher percentage of our sales to Chinese customers that the CFR index price or spot sales volume in the first quarter was approximately 48% of total volumes, compared to a normal expectation of approximately 20%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2021 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"Demurrage and other charges reduced our gross price realization to an average net selling price of $123 per short ton in the second quarter of 2021 compared to $108 per short ton in the same quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2021 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"But it did help us achieve 100% of the benchmark that really kind of drove up the realization -- gross profit -- I'm sorry the gross price realization for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2021 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"Demurrage and other charges reduced our gross price realization to an average net selling price of $189 per short ton in the third quarter this year compared to $91 per short ton in the same quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2021 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"So we're really not seeing any net inflation yet that's hitting us, but we do hear from suppliers about cost going up for next year and expectations around price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/warrior-met-coal-inc-hcc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"HCC 2025 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Chopin","x":"While trade tensions continue to weigh heavily on global market sentiment, the European Union recently announced plans to protect the EU steel sector from the unfair impacts of global steel overcapacity by limiting import volumes and doubling the level of tariffs to 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2025 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"We achieved a gross price realization of 83% for the third quarter compared to 93% in last year's same quarter, which was a function of relative index pricing, product mix, geography, tariffs, and freight rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2025 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Chopin","x":"The accelerated Blue Creek longwall startup enables us to increase our guidance for total company production and sales volumes for 2025, as you will have seen in our earnings release.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2025 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian Chopin","x":"This increase in production from Blue Creek raises our full-year outlook for production volume by approximately 10% at the midpoint of the range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"In addition, we are experiencing some tariffs and higher shipping costs on these raw materials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"We achieved a gross price realization of 72% for the first quarter compared to 75% in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Walter J. Scheller","x":"Our gross price realization was lower and driven by a combination of factors.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q1","e":"hcc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dale W. Boyles","x":"First quarter results were all on track and generally consistent with our expectations for the full year, and that is why we are reaffirming our outlook and guidance for 2026 as previously communicated in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter Scheller","x":"We achieved gross price realization of 66% for the second quarter this year compared to 80% in the second quarter of 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q2","e":"hcc","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Walter Scheller","x":"Second, freight rates to Asia, primarily India, were about $13 per ton or 37% higher in the second quarter of 2026 than last year's second quarter and reduced our gross price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Walter Scheller","x":"I think if the tariffs went away and there were spot opportunities, we would look at those spot opportunities and determine if we had the additional volume and we thought those opportunities were really good opportunities, we would certainly consider them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/warrior-met-coal-hcc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HCC 2026 Q3","e":"hcc","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Geor